                <pb facs="0200" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg96"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Mizner</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 3,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Mizner is instructed to make a full report in writing respecting the
                    attempted arrest of Barrundia, presenting all the facts possible to obtain as to
                    what happened on the vessel. He was also to obtain the affidavit of the
                    captain.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
